      "text": "gave them power against unclean spirits, Matt. 10:1. When the unclean spirit is gone out of a man, Matt. 12:43. full of dead men’s bones, and of all uncleanness, Matt. 23:27. vexed with unclean spirits, Luke 6:18. Peter said … I have never eaten any thing that is common or unclean, Acts 10:14. not call any man common or unclean, Acts 10:28. What God hath cleansed, that call not thou common, Acts 11:9. God also gave them up to uncleanness, Rom. 1:24. ye have yielded your members servants to uncleanness, Rom. 6:19. there is nothing unclean of itself, Rom. 14:14. else were your children unclean, 1 Cor. 7:14. have not repented of the uncleanness, 2 Cor. 12:21. works of the flesh are … fornication, uncleanness, Gal. 5:19. given themselves … to work all uncleanness, Eph. 4:19. nor unclean person … hath any inheritance, Eph. 5:5. Mortify therefore your members … fornication, uncleanness, Col. 3:5. exhortation was not of deceit, nor of uncleanness, 1 Thes. 2:3. God hath not called us unto uncleanness, 1 Thes. 4:7. them that walk … in the lust of uncleanness, 2 Pet. 2:10.",
